<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>북비티아이(Book-BTI) ✨ 나의 성향에 맞는 책 찾기</title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <!-- Google Fonts: Gowun Dodum (깔끔하고 귀여우며 신뢰감 있는 폰트) & Gowun Batang & SUIT -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gowun+Batang:wght@400;700&family=Gowun+Dodum&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sunn-us/SUIT/fonts/static/woff2/SUIT.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <!-- Canvas Confetti for Micro-Interaction Feedback -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>

  <style>
    /* =========================================================
       폰트 설정: 고운돋움 (Gowun Dodum) + 서울남산체 + 서울한강체 + SUIT
       깔끔하고 귀여우면서도 학교 현장의 신뢰감을 주는 타이포그래피
       ========================================================= */
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'SeoulNamsan';
      font-weight: 500;
      font-style: normal;
      src: local('서울남산체 M'), local('SeoulNamsanM'), local('서울남산체'),
           url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/webfontworld/seoul/SeoulNamsanMedium.woff2') format('woff2'),
           url('https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_two@1.0/SeoulNamsanM.woff') format('woff');
      font-display: swap;
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'SeoulNamsan';
      font-weight: 700;
      font-style: normal;
      src: local('서울남산체 B'), local('SeoulNamsanB'),
           url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/webfontworld/seoul/SeoulNamsanBold.woff2') format('woff2'),
           url('https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_two@1.0/SeoulNamsanM.woff') format('woff');
      font-display: swap;
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'SeoulHangang';
      font-weight: 700;
      font-style: normal;
      src: local('서울한강체 B'), local('SeoulHangangB'), local('서울한강체'),
           url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/webfontworld/seoul/SeoulHangangBold.woff2') format('woff2'),
           url('https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_two@1.0/SeoulHangangM.woff') format('woff');
      font-display: swap;
    }

    :root {
      --font-namsan: 'Gowun Dodum', 'SeoulNamsan', 'SUIT', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      --font-hangang: 'Gowun Dodum', 'SeoulHangang', 'Gowun Batang', sans-serif;
      --navy-dark: #1B263B;
      --navy-mid: #273752;
      --navy-soft: #415A77;
      --beige-bg: #F7F5F0;
      --beige-card: #FAF8F5;
      --beige-border: #E2D9C8;
      --camel-accent: #C89B6E;
      --camel-dark: #B07D4F;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-namsan);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      background-color: var(--beige-bg);
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(#E5DEC9 1.5px, transparent 1.5px),
        radial-gradient(#DCE2EC 1.5px, #F7F5F0 1.5px);
      background-size: 36px 36px;
      background-position: 0 0, 18px 18px;
      color: var(--navy-dark);
      word-break: keep-all;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .font-namsan {
      font-family: var(--font-namsan);
    }

    .font-hangang {
      font-family: var(--font-hangang);
    }

    /* Beige & Navy Card & Tactile Micro-interactions */
    .fancy-card {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 3px solid var(--beige-border);
      border-radius: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--beige-border), 0 16px 32px rgba(27, 38, 59, 0.07);
      transition: transform 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), box-shadow 0.22s ease;
    }

    /* Quiz Answer Button Style (Beige & Navy) */
    .quiz-choice-btn {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 3px solid var(--beige-border);
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 0 var(--beige-border);
      transition: all 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    }
    .quiz-choice-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: var(--navy-dark);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FAF8F5 0%, #F2EFE9 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--camel-accent);
    }
    .quiz-choice-btn:active {
      transform: translateY(2px);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 0 var(--navy-dark);
    }

    /* KDC Cute Button Active State (Beige & Navy) */
    .kdc-btn {
      transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
      border: 2.5px solid var(--beige-border);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--beige-border);
    }
    .kdc-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: var(--navy-soft);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #D0C6B4;
    }
    .kdc-badge-active {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1B263B 0%, #2E4057 100%) !important;
      color: #FAF8F5 !important;
      border-color: #1B263B !important;
      transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.03);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #C89B6E, 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(27, 38, 59, 0.28) !important;
    }
    .kdc-badge-active .kdc-sub {
      color: #F5CBA7 !important;
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14) !important;
    }

    /* Floating animation for mascot */
    @keyframes floatSlow {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(-2deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(2deg); }
    }
    .animate-float {
      animation: floatSlow 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    /* Active Character Parts Animations */
    @keyframes charBounce {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) scale(1); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.03, 0.98); }
    }
    @keyframes charWaveRight {
      0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      50% { transform: rotate(-18deg) translateY(-2px); }
    }
    @keyframes charWaveLeft {
      0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      50% { transform: rotate(16deg) translateY(-2px); }
    }
    @keyframes charFootStep {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-4px) rotate(8deg); }
    }
    @keyframes charBlink {
      0%, 92%, 100% { transform: scaleY(1); }
      96% { transform: scaleY(0.12); }
    }
    @keyframes charTwinkle {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.85) rotate(0deg); }
      50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.18) rotate(12deg); }
    }
    .svg-char-body {
      animation: charBounce 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
      transform-origin: 60px 80px;
    }
    .svg-char-prop {
      animation: charWaveRight 1.1s ease-in-out infinite;
      transform-origin: 86px 72px;
    }
    .svg-char-arm-l {
      animation: charWaveLeft 1.1s ease-in-out infinite;
      transform-origin: 34px 72px;
    }
    .svg-char-eyes {
      animation: charBlink 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;
      transform-origin: 60px 58px;
    }
    .svg-char-foot-l {
      animation: charFootStep 0.9s ease-in-out infinite;
      transform-origin: 48px 98px;
    }
    .svg-char-foot-r {
      animation: charFootStep 0.9s ease-in-out infinite 0.45s;
      transform-origin: 72px 98px;
    }
    .svg-char-sparkle {
      animation: charTwinkle 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
      transform-origin: center;
    }

    @keyframes popIn {
      0% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.94) translateY(10px); }
      100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
    }
    .animate-pop {
      animation: popIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;
    }

    /* Custom Character Mouse Clicker Follower */
    #char-cursor-follower {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9999;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      transition: transform 0.06s ease-out;
      will-change: left, top, transform;
    }
    #char-cursor-follower.clicking {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.82) rotate(-12deg);
    }

    /* Sparkle burst on click */
    .click-sparkle {
      position: fixed;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9998;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      animation: sparkleFly 0.65s ease-out forwards;
    }
    @keyframes sparkleFly {
      0% { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.6); }
      100% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -120%) scale(1.35); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen selection:bg-[#1B263B] selection:text-[#FAF8F5]">

  <!-- Custom Floating Character Mouse Clicker (Active in KDC Step) -->
  <div id="char-cursor-follower" class="hidden">
    <div class="relative flex items-center">
      <!-- Cute 16-Type Custom Character Avatar Pointer -->
      <div id="cursor-avatar-ring" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#FAF8F5] border-3 border-[#1B263B] shadow-[0_6px_16px_rgba(27,38,59,0.32)] flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-visible">
        <div id="cursor-char-svg" class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center"></div>
        <span class="-top-1.5 -left-1.5 text-sm absolute drop-shadow-xs">👆</span>
      </div>
      <!-- Mini Character Name Tag -->
      <div id="cursor-char-label" class="ml-2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#1B263B] text-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#C89B6E] text-xs font-bold rounded-full shadow-md whitespace-nowrap">
        다정한 명탐정
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Top Floating Navigation Bar (Beige & Navy Theme) -->
  <nav class="sticky top-3 z-50 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 py-3 bg-[#FFFFFF]/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full shadow-[0_6px_0_#E2D9C8,0_10px_20px_rgba(27,38,59,0.08)] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-2 border-[#D8CEBE] my-4 gap-2">
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5 pl-1 cursor-pointer" onclick="switchView('interactive')">
      <span class="text-2xl animate-bounce">📚</span>
      <div>
        <span class="font-hangang font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#1B263B] tracking-tight">북비티아이</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline-block ml-1.5 px-3 py-0.5 bg-[#F4EFE6] text-[#1B263B] border border-[#D8CEBE] rounded-full text-xs font-bold">나의 성향에 맞는 책 찾기</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Mode Switch Tabs -->
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 bg-[#F4EFE6] p-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#D8CEBE]">
      <button id="tab-interactive" onclick="switchView('interactive')" class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-[#1B263B] text-[#FAF8F5] text-sm font-bold rounded-full transition duration-200 flex items-center space-x-1.5 shadow-sm">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-compass text-[#F5CBA7]"></i>
        <span>나의 성향에 맞는 책 찾기</span>
      </button>
      <button id="tab-leaflet" onclick="switchView('leaflet')" class="px-4 py-1.5 text-[#1B263B] hover:bg-[#E8E0D2] text-sm font-bold rounded-full transition duration-200 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-shapes"></i>
        <span>16유형 한눈에 보기</span>
      </button>
      <a href="worksheets.html" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[#415A77] hover:bg-[#E8E0D2] text-sm font-bold rounded-full transition duration-200 flex items-center space-x-1.5">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square"></i>
        <span class="hidden md:inline">독서 활동지</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>


  <!-- =========================================================================
       VIEW 1: 단계별 화면 전환 시스템 (베이지 & 네이비 테마)
       Screen 1: 시작 화면
       Screen 2: 20문항 퀴즈 화면
       Screen 3: 나의 북비티아이 캐릭터 결과 확인 창
       Screen 4: 캐릭터 마우스클릭터 + KDC 주제 선택 & 경운중학교 DLS 도서 추천 + 독서 활동 학습지 연동
       ========================================================================= -->
  <main id="view-interactive" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pb-16 pt-2">

    <!-- [SCREEN 1] 인트로 시작 화면 -->
    <section id="screen-intro" class="fancy-card p-8 sm:p-12 text-center relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#FAF8F5] via-[#FFFFFF] to-[#F2EFE9] animate-pop">
      <div class="-top-12 -right-12 w-44 h-44 bg-[#E5DEC9]/50 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none absolute"></div>
      <div class="-bottom-12 -left-12 w-44 h-44 bg-[#DCE2EC]/50 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none absolute"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Cute Mascot Showcase -->
        <div id="intro-mascot-showcase" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 sm:space-x-4 bg-[#FAF8F5] border-2 border-[#D8CEBE] rounded-3xl px-5 py-3 shadow-sm mb-6 animate-float">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-[#1B263B] text-[#FAF8F5] text-sm font-bold rounded-full shadow-sm">
            ✨ Book-BTI 테스트
          </span>
          <span class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-[#F4EFE6] text-[#1B263B] border-2 border-[#C89B6E] text-sm font-bold rounded-full">
            📖 나의 성향에 맞는 책 찾기
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-hangang text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-[#1B263B] leading-tight tracking-tight">
          나만의 독서 캐릭터 &<br>
          <span class="text-[#B07D4F] underline decoration-[#C89B6E] decoration-dashed underline-offset-8">맞춤 인생 책 찾기</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="font-namsan text-base sm:text-lg text-[#415A77] mt-5 leading-relaxed">
          재미있는 <strong class="text-[#1B263B]">20가지 질문</strong>을 풀면 나만의 귀엽고 활발한 <strong class="text-[#1B263B]">16유형 북비티아이 캐릭터</strong>가 탄생해요!<br>
          내 캐릭터 마우스로 <strong class="text-[#1B263B]">KDC 10대 주제별 추천 도서</strong>를 고르고 나만의 인생 책을 만나 보세요 ✨
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <button onclick="startQuiz()" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-10 py-4 bg-[#1B263B] hover:bg-[#273752] text-[#FAF8F5] font-hangang text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold rounded-full shadow-[0_6px_0_#C89B6E,0_12px_20px_rgba(27,38,59,0.2)] active:translate-y-1 transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-3">
            <span>나의 성향에 맞는 책 찾기 시작!</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-play text-base text-[#F5CBA7]"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- [SCREEN 2] 20문항 퀴즈 화면 (한 문제씩 화면 전환) -->
    <section id="screen-quiz" class="fancy-card p-6 sm:p-10 hidden relative overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <!-- Top Progress Header -->
      <div class="mb-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span id="quiz-axis-badge" class="px-3.5 py-1 bg-[#F4EFE6] text-[#1B263B] border border-[#D8CEBE] text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold rounded-full">
              관계 & 소통 영역
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#526071]">나와 더 비슷한 모습을 골라보세요!</span>
          </div>
          <div class="font-namsan font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#1B263B]">
            <span id="quiz-current-num">1</span> <span class="text-[#C89B6E]">/</span> 20
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Beige & Navy Progress Bar -->
        <div class="w-full h-4 bg-[#F4EFE6] rounded-full overflow-hidden p-0.5 border border-[#D8CEBE]">
          <div id="quiz-progress-bar" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1B263B] via-[#415A77] to-[#C89B6E] rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 5%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Question Box -->
      <div id="quiz-question-box" class="text-center py-7 px-4 rounded-3xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border-2 border-[#E2D9C8] mb-6">
        <div id="quiz-emoji" class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl mb-3">🗣️</div>
        <h2 id="quiz-question-text" class="font-hangang text-xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1B263B] leading-snug">
          재미있는 책을 다 읽었을 때 나의 첫 반응은?
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- 2 Choice Buttons -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <button id="btn-choice-a" onclick="selectAnswer('A')" class="quiz-choice-btn p-6 text-left flex flex-col justify-between group">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between w-full mb-3">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-2xl bg-[#F4EFE6] group-hover:bg-[#1B263B] text-[#1B263B] group-hover:text-[#FAF8F5] font-bold text-base flex items-center justify-center transition">A</span>
            <span id="choice-a-emoji" class="text-3xl">💬</span>
          </div>
          <p id="choice-a-text" class="font-namsan text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#1B263B] leading-relaxed">
            친구나 가족에게 달려가서 "이 책 진짜 대박이야!" 하고 줄거리를 신나게 떠든다.
          </p>
        </button>

        <button id="btn-choice-b" onclick="selectAnswer('B')" class="quiz-choice-btn p-6 text-left flex flex-col justify-between group">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between w-full mb-3">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-2xl bg-[#EAEFF5] group-hover:bg-[#1B263B] text-[#1B263B] group-hover:text-[#FAF8F5] font-bold text-base flex items-center justify-center transition">B</span>
            <span id="choice-b-emoji" class="text-3xl">🎧</span>
          </div>
          <p id="choice-b-text" class="font-namsan text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#1B263B] leading-relaxed">
            책을 덮고 가만히 눈을 감으며 마지막 장면의 여운을 혼자 조용히 곱씹는다.
          </p>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Quiz Bottom Navigation -->
      <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#E2D9C8] flex items-center justify-between">
        <button id="btn-prev-q" onclick="prevQuestion()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-[#F4EFE6] hover:bg-[#E5DEC9] text-[#1B263B] rounded-full text-sm font-bold transition flex items-center space-x-1.5">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
          <span>이전 질문</span>
        </button>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#526071]">20문항을 모두 풀면 내 북비티아이 캐릭터가 나타나요!</span>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- [SCREEN 3] 나의 북비티아이 결과 확인 창 (귀여운 캐릭터 등장) -->
    <section id="screen-result" class="fancy-card p-7 sm:p-10 hidden text-center relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#FAF8F5] via-[#FFFFFF] to-[#F2EFE9]">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-[#F4EFE6] text-[#1B263B] border border-[#C89B6E] rounded-full text-sm font-bold mb-3">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-sparkles text-[#B07D4F]"></i>
          <span>짜잔! 20문항 분석 완료 · 나의 북비티아이 탄생!</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Cute Custom 16-Type Active Character Card -->
        <div class="my-4 flex flex-col items-center">
          <div id="result-char-stage" class="w-48 h-48 sm:w-56 sm:h-56 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-[#1B263B] shadow-[0_10px_0_#C89B6E,0_18px_36px_rgba(27,38,59,0.2)] flex flex-col items-center justify-center animate-float relative">
            <div id="res-svg-avatar" class="w-40 h-40 sm:w-48 sm:h-48 flex items-center justify-center"></div>
