      <section class="mb-7">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
          <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] border-2 border-[#D8CEBE] rounded-2xl p-3.5">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#1B263B]">1축. 관계 지표 (P vs I)</div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#415A77] mt-1 leading-snug font-namsan">
              <strong class="text-[#1B263B]">P(People)</strong> 수다형 북토크<br>
              <strong class="text-[#1B263B]">I(Inner)</strong> 고요한 사색 묵독
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] border-2 border-[#D8CEBE] rounded-2xl p-3.5">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#1B263B]">2축. 사고 지표 (L vs W)</div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#415A77] mt-1 leading-snug font-namsan">
              <strong class="text-[#1B263B]">L(Logic)</strong> 복선 추리·논리<br>
              <strong class="text-[#1B263B]">W(Word)</strong> 감성 문장·말맛
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] border-2 border-[#D8CEBE] rounded-2xl p-3.5">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#1B263B]">3축. 감각 지표 (S vs M)</div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#415A77] mt-1 leading-snug font-namsan">
              <strong class="text-[#1B263B]">S(Scene)</strong> 영화 같은 장면 상상<br>
              <strong class="text-[#1B263B]">M(Melody)</strong> 대사 말투·리듬감
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] border-2 border-[#D8CEBE] rounded-2xl p-3.5">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#1B263B]">4축. 행동 지표 (N vs K)</div>
